   "spoken": "This is the critical fork in the road. Three or four sound setups exist here; the Four Pawns Attack is the one for the player who wants to punish the Alekhine — little theory to learn, and a real chance to blow Black off the board.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Pick your weapon by temperament — the Four Pawns is the aggressive, low-theory way to meet the Alekhine.",
