   "spoken": "Only now, with Black's bishop already committed to f5 and the queen's knight developed, is the knight to f3 safe — the g4-pin has lost its bite. Order of development is everything in this line.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Delay the king's knight until the enemy bishop can no longer pin it profitably.",
